    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Property Partners Gill & Glynn are pleased to present to market this 0.56 acre site located in a well-established rural residential area, approximately 2 km from Clarinbridge Village, which offers a range of local amenities including shops, cafés, restaurants, primary schools, church, and community facilities.\n\nFolio for the indicated site is GY1052, 0.23 ha (0.57acre)\n\nOranmore Village is situated approximately 6 km away, providing a broader range of services including secondary schools, retail outlets, and public transport links.\n\nThe area enjoys good connectivity via local and regional road networks, allowing easy access to Galway city. Kilcornan Woods, a popular local woodland and recreational amenity, is located nearby and offers excellent opportunities for walking and outdoor leisure activities.\n\nThe site being sold subject to planning and is subject to the Local Housing Need Policy.\n\nFor further information please contact the selling agent Emma Gill on 087 799 9955\n\nAttention is drawn to this important notice:\nThe particulars are set out as a general outline for the guidance of intending purchasers and do not constitute, nor constitute part of, an offer or contract. All descriptions, dimensions, references to condition and necessary permissions for use and occupation and other details are given in good faith and are believed to be correct, but any intending purchasers should not rely on them as statements or representations of fact and must satisfy themselves by inspection or otherwise as to the correctness of each of them. All measurements are approximate and maps and photographs are for guidance purposes only."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Notice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Negotiator",
        "SortOrder": 10,
        "Content": "Emma Gill"
      }
